    "plain_text": "Olivier Dewavrin is a French retail entrepreneur who founded the electronics chains King-Musique and Surcouf. After an early attempt to make hi-fi affordable through a store network, he created a hands-on computer marketplace in Paris. Surcouf combined brand stands, demonstrations, repair services and component sales before its controlling stake was sold to the PPR group.",
